# =====================================================
#  AURELIA GRAND RESORT — API TESTLERİ
#  Önce A1 ve A3'ü çalıştır (token'lar alınır)
# =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


# ============ A) GİRİŞ ============

### A1) Admin girişi (Kardelen) → 200, role: "admin"
# @name admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kardelen@aurelia.com",
  "password": "Aurelia2026!"
}

### A2) Müşteri kaydı → 201 (ikinci kez 409, normal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Elif Demir",
  "email": "elif@example.com",
  "password": "Musteri2026!"
}

### A3) Müşteri girişi → 200, role: "customer"
# @name customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "elif@example.com",
  "password": "Musteri2026!"
}

### A4) Ben kimim? (müşteri) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}


# ============ P) HERKESE AÇIK ============

### P1) Oda tipleri (token yok) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types

### P2) Müsait oda arama (token yok) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/available?checkIn=2027-05-10&checkOut=2027-05-12&guests=2

### P3) Tüm odalar — token yok → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms

### P4) Tüm odalar — müşteri → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### P5) Tüm odalar — admin → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}


# ============ C) MÜŞTERİ ============

### C1) Rezervasyon oluştur (oda 102) → 201 (ikinci kez 409, normal)
# @name myRes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-05-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-05-12",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### C2) Benim rezervasyonlarım → 200 (sadece Elif'inkiler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/my
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C3) Ödeme yap → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{myRes.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### C4) Başkasının (Ayşe) rezervasyonunu görme → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C5) Tüm rezervasyonlar (müşteri) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C6) Check-in deneme (müşteri) → 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{myRes.response.body.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### C7) Kendi rezervasyonunu iptal → 200, cancelled
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{myRes.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}


# ============ D) ADMIN ============

### D1) Tüm rezervasyonlar → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D2) Ayşe'nin rezervasyonları → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/user/2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D3) Müşterinin rezervasyonunu görüntüle → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{myRes.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D4) Oda ekle (601) → 201 (ikinci kez 409, normal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "601",
  "roomTypeId": 2,
  "floor": 6
}

### D5) Gelecek tarihli rezervasyona check-in → 400 (kural)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}


# ============ S) GÜVENLİK ============

### S1) Token olmadan rezervasyon → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "checkInDate": "2027-06-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-06-03",
  "guestCount": 1
}

### S2) Sahte token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/my
Authorization: Bearer bu.sahte.token



# ============ E) DASHBOARD ============
# Önce A1 ve A3'ü çalıştırmış olmalısın

### E1) Dashboard (admin) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### E2) Dashboard (müşteri) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}

### E3) Müşteri: BUGÜN başlayan rezervasyon (oda 202) → 201 (aynı gün tekrar 409)
# @name todayStay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 5,
  "checkInDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD'}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{$localDatetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 3 d}}",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### E4) Müşteri öder → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{todayStay.response.body.id}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customer.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

### E5) Dashboard → arrivalsToday'de 202 görünmeli, occupiedRooms arttı, gelir arttı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### E6) Admin check-in → 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/{{todayStay.response.body.id}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### E7) Dashboard → arrivalsToday boş, inHouseCount arttı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}



# ============ F) CORS ============
# Tarayıcının istekten önce gönderdiği "izin var mı?" sorusunu taklit eder

### F1) Angular adresi → 200, cevapta "Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:4200"
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### F2) İzinsiz adres → 403
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types
Origin: http://kotu-site.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET